---
import { GITHUB_URL, LINKEDIN_URL, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title={`About · ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="About Tim Hilt">
	<h1>About</h1>
	<img src="/me.jpeg" alt="Portrait of Tim Hilt" width="2128" height="1894" />

	<p>
		Hi, I'm Tim. I believe most problems at work aren't technical: they come from poor communication
		and organization. That's why I care about clarity, both in how teams work together and in how
		software is built.
	</p>
	<p>
		At{' '}
		<a href="https://festo.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
			Festo
		</a>{' '}
		in Esslingen, Germany, I evolve the architecture of a large embedded software platform (>1M
		LOC), with a focus on performance and low memory footprint. I also coach our engineers in
		agentic coding to help them become more productive.
	</p>
	<p>
		I like Espresso, Split Mechanical Keyboards and Road Cycling. I'm married and a father of three
		boys. I'm a follower of Jesus Christ and invest in young children by teaching in sunday school.
	</p>
	<p>
		Follow along via <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>, or connect with me on{' '}
		<a href={LINKEDIN_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
			LinkedIn
		</a>{' '}
		or{' '}
		<a href={GITHUB_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
			GitHub
		</a>
		.
	</p>
</Page>

<style>
	img {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 20rem;
		height: auto;
		border-radius: 0.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}
</style>
